  {
   "t0": 0.55,
   "t1": 4.459,
   "text": "In five weeks, NVIDIA\u2019s value fell by **$1.8 trillion.**"
  },
  {
   "t0": 4.619,
   "t1": 8.381,
   "text": "That\u2019s almost half of India\u2019s yearly economy, **wiped off its share price.**"
  },
  {
   "t0": 8.381,
   "t1": 8.863,
   "text": "How?"
  },
  {
   "t0": 9.023,
   "t1": 11.634,
   "text": "NVIDIA makes the chips **AI runs on.**"
  },
  {
   "t0": 11.634,
   "t1": 14.115,
   "text": "ChatGPT needs **thousands** of them."
  },
  {
   "t0": 14.275,
   "t1": 19.592,
   "text": "Every tech giant wanted them, so in October NVIDIA hit a record **$5.8 trillion.**"
  },
  {
   "t0": 19.752,
   "t1": 21.349,
   "text": "Then, within weeks, **three shocks.**"
  },
  {
   "t0": 21.509,
   "t1": 26.31,
   "text": "One: US voters passed local rules that could **slow new AI data centres.**"
  },
  {
   "t0": 26.47,
   "t1": 30.325,
   "text": "Two: NVIDIA invests in AI start-ups, who then buy its chips."
  },
  {
   "t0": 30.325,
   "t1": 31.843,
   "text": "**Is that real demand?**"
  },
  {
   "t0": 32.003,
   "t1": 36.286,
   "text": "Three: its CEO, Jensen Huang, **stepped down** amid a board investigation."
  },
  {
   "t0": 36.446,
   "t1": 37.034,
   "text": "Bubble?"
  },
  {
   "t0": 37.034,
   "t1": 38.661,
   "text": "Sales still **doubled** in a year."
  },
  {
   "t0": 38.661,
   "t1": 40.469,
   "text": "Investors just fear it won\u2019t last."
  },
  {
   "t0": 40.629,
   "t1": 42.513,
   "text": "A share price is a bet on the future."
  },
  {
   "t0": 42.513,
   "t1": 44.266,
   "text": "**The bet flipped, not the business.**"
  },
  {
   "t0": 44.426,
   "t1": 45.942,
   "text": "Follow InvisiTech for more."
  }
